{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LightPoint\u00a0</strong>is a free-form real-time strategy (RTS) tower defense game.<br>As an &quot;Anchor,&quot; you'll battle enigmatic Graphical Entities and bring light to those trapped in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harvest resources, build defenses</strong>, and hold the line until victory is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face challenging bosses</strong> and master diverse build strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498100/extras/639fe5d1321cb392b20309cdf8c2cde1.poster.avif?t=1753198596\" width=400 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498100/extras/639fe5d1321cb392b20309cdf8c2cde1.webm?t=1753198596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498100/extras/639fe5d1321cb392b20309cdf8c2cde1.mp4?t=1753198596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Real-Time Strategy</strong>: Build defenses at any moment \u2013 prepare strategically or react under pressure. Protect your territory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498100/extras/6f30332f43beeca82b74d4d57a5e63a2.poster.avif?t=1753198596\" width=400 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498100/extras/6f30332f43beeca82b74d4d57a5e63a2.webm?t=1753198596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Illuminate the Darkness</strong>: Deploy light sources to r